input: {
    "context": "{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:35:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-0-72171\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-0-72171\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:39:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a problem with 'Faulty Authentication Token Expiry Handling'. The API isn't consistently handling expired tokens, which could lead to data handling errors in client applications. This is impacting Customer CUST-0059 and affects the API Layer. @eid_57e922c4, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-1-7945b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-1-7945b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:43:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll look into the token expiry handling issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-2-ea521\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-2-ea521\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:44:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Misleading Error Messages for Data Validation Failures'. The API is returning generic error messages, which is confusing for developers. This affects the API Layer and impacts Customer CUST-0007. @eid_b7702c98, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-3-19319\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-3-19319\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:45:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the error messages and make sure they're more descriptive. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-4-b6548\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-4-b6548\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:48:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Data Replication Lag' issue causing outdated forecast data to be served due to lag between database nodes. This is affecting the Database Management System and impacting Customer CUST-0005. @eid_b7702c98, can you also take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-5-9569e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-5-9569e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:52:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, I'll tackle the replication lag as well. Let's get these sorted out for our customers! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-6-bea3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-6-bea3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any more details or run into issues, just shout. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-7-2c175\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-7-2c175\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:56:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll update once I have more info on the token issue. 🕵️‍♂️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-8-e597c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-8-e597c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T14:00:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the error messages and replication lag. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_bd791efc! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-9-75819\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-9-75819\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect data being served due to data replication lag has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/41.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-0-57529\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-0-57529\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:08:00\", \"text\": \"That's great news, Bob! Can you explain what was causing the lag?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-1-792ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-1-792ae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:10:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Alice. The root cause was network latency and insufficient bandwidth allocation, which were delaying the synchronization of forecast data between the primary and secondary database nodes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-2-9e500\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-2-9e500\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:15:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Bob. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-3-fd5f1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-3-fd5f1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:17:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I optimized the network configuration to prioritize replication traffic and increased the bandwidth allocation for the replication process. This ensures that the data syncs more efficiently and reduces the lag significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-4-d1b3d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-4-d1b3d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:20:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_b7702c98! This should improve the user experience a lot.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-5-e4ee5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-5-e4ee5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, thanks for handling this so quickly, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-6-2360f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-6-2360f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:24:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks stable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-7-c3d67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-7-c3d67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T19:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Insecure Password Reset Mechanism'.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-0-9092d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-0-9092d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T19:57:00\", \"text\": \"The concern was that the password reset functionality allows attackers to reset user passwords without proper verification, potentially leading to unauthorized account access.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-1-ca0a2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-1-ca0a2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:00:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the authentication module, I found that the current implementation is actually working as intended.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-2-2e136\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-2-2e136\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:01:00\", \"text\": \"The system is designed to use email-based verification, which is considered secure for our current threat model and user base.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-3-5342d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-3-5342d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:04:00\", \"text\": \"The lack of multi-factor authentication or secure token validation was noted, but these are not requirements for our current security policy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-4-bbc3a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-4-bbc3a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:06:00\", \"text\": \"I verified that the email verification process is functioning correctly and securely, ensuring that only users with access to the registered email can reset their passwords.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-5-0d4ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-5-0d4ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:10:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_c702b642 Thanks for the update, Alice. So, just to confirm, no changes are needed at this point?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-6-7cd55\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-6-7cd55\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:15:00\", \"text\": \"That's correct, Charlie. No changes are necessary as the system is operating within our defined security parameters.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-7-b5401\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-7-b5401\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:16:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for clarifying, Alice. It's good to know that the email verification is secure enough for now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-8-a0ae8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-8-a0ae8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:20:00\", \"text\": \"You're welcome, David. If our security requirements evolve, we can revisit this and consider implementing additional verification steps.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-9-47b3e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-9-47b3e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:22:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good. Thanks for the thorough review, Alice!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-10-a7783\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-10-a7783\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:27:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there are any other concerns.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-11-71294\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-11-71294\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T17:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/30.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-0-937aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-0-937aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T17:59:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was that our authentication module was using outdated cryptographic algorithms like MD5 and SHA-1 for password storage, which are not secure enough.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-1-0e754\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-1-0e754\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:00:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Bob! What changes did you make to fix this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-2-812b2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-2-812b2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:02:00\", \"text\": \"Good question, Alice. I updated the authentication module to use bcrypt for hashing passwords. Bcrypt is more secure as it incorporates a salt and is computationally intensive, making it much harder to crack.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-3-ec609\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-3-ec609\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:03:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_b7702c98! Does this change affect any other parts of the system?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-4-574b1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-4-574b1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:06:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David. The change is isolated to the password storage mechanism, so it shouldn't affect other parts of the system. However, I recommend everyone to test their modules just to be sure.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-5-4224c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-5-4224c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:09:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, Bob. Thanks for the heads-up!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-6-5255a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-6-5255a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:10:00\", \"text\": \"I'll run some tests on my end too. Thanks for the quick resolution!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-7-106d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-7-106d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:14:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you encounter any issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-8-2e1b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-8-2e1b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:32:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Data Parsing Algorithm' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/33.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-0-83580\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-0-83580\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:33:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was identified as the algorithm's single-threaded approach, which became a bottleneck when processing large datasets. This led to slow parsing and delayed visualization updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-1-0f243\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-1-0f243\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:37:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I refactored the algorithm to utilize a multi-threaded approach. This allows it to handle large volumes of data more efficiently by distributing the workload across multiple threads.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-2-c295a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-2-c295a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_8333ab24! This should significantly improve the performance for our users dealing with large datasets.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-3-9bef5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-3-9bef5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia! This was a critical fix. I'll run some tests on our end to ensure everything is working smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-4-f03af\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-4-f03af\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:47:00\", \"text\": \"Nice job, Julia. Let me know if you need any help with the deployment process.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-5-7ed29\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-5-7ed29\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:48:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_cc27a0cd, @eid_6d9f2150, and David! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing or deployment.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-6-cf771\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-6-cf771\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:26:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Delayed Response Time Leading to Timeout Errors' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/34.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-0-af64b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-0-af64b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:31:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_6d9f2150! Could you explain what was causing the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-1-aef9b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-1-aef9b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:35:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Julia. The root cause was an inefficient query execution plan in the database layer. It was creating bottlenecks during peak usage times, which led to delayed API responses and eventually timeout errors.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-2-12dbd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-2-12dbd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:36:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-3-da7c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-3-da7c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:39:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I optimized the query execution plan by adding appropriate indexes and restructuring some of the queries to be more efficient. This significantly reduced the processing time and eliminated the bottlenecks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-4-5aa32\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-4-5aa32\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:40:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome work, Hannah! This should improve our API performance a lot during peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-5-28b62\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-5-28b62\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:42:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you notice any further issues or if there's anything else I can help with.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-6-84591\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-6-84591\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the quick turnaround, Hannah. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics and let you know if anything comes up.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-7-de605\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-7-de605\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:45:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone. Let's monitor the system closely over the next few days to ensure everything is stable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-8-1bc0b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-8-1bc0b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-0-7b78c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-0-7b78c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:01:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Engine'. The visualization engine is consuming too much memory when rendering large datasets, causing slow performance and crashes. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0120. @eid_57e922c4, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-1-7477b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-1-7477b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:05:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-2-cee77\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-2-cee77\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:07:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy'. The current strategy isn't efficiently storing and retrieving large datasets, leading to slow visualization updates. This also affects the User Interface & Visualization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0071. @eid_57e922c4, you're on this one too.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-3-97b30\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-3-97b30\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:12:00\", \"text\": \"Understood, I'll tackle the data caching issue as well. If anyone has insights or suggestions, feel free to share! 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-4-ddff3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-4-ddff3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_57e922c4! Lastly, we have a 'Categorical Encoding Discrepancy'. Incorrect encoding of categorical variables is leading to misinterpretations by the forecasting model. This affects the Data Preprocessing Module and impacts customer CUST-0043. @eid_6d9f2150, can you handle this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-5-c6881\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-5-c6881\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:17:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the encoding issue and ensure we get accurate predictions. If anyone has encountered similar issues before, let's chat! 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-6-f0988\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-6-f0988\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:21:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or resources. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-7-1cea6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-7-1cea6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:24:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Let's get these sorted for our customers. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-8-83e2c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-8-83e2c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Looking forward to resolving these issues. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-9-514f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-9-514f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bd791efc created this channel on 2026-08-24 15:19:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-0-6771d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-0-6771d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bd791efc joined bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce. Also, @eid_6d9f2150, @eid_9685a278, @eid_c702b642, @eid_57e922c4, @eid_cc27a0cd, @eid_8333ab24, @eid_b7702c98 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-1-4460b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-1-4460b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:20:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-0-19ec3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-0-19ec3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:23:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a security concern: **Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords**. Passwords are stored using weak encryption algorithms, which could lead to unauthorized access. This affects the Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_b7702c98, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-1-def94\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-1-def94\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"chann