ctions. https://venturebeat.com/2023/09/15/the-rise-of-ai-driven-task-management-tools/\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260725-107-ac8b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260725-107-ac8b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-onForceX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-orcex-60b1fb\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bed67c52\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-25T05:26:00\", \"text\": \"Great feedback, everyone! @eid_5890ce38, I'll look into RabbitMQ as an al",
